Cell["\<\
Encodes the interaction-net duplication\[Dash]annihilation law: when a copy \
meets its co-copy head-on, both disappear and their legs join pairwise.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e3b1dc05-6450-44ec-a5fa-14f44c3d14ae"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4ebe6a96-692b-4338-ad25-318a06659b22"],

